    "detailed_description": "In To Infinity, a challenging parkour game, overcome challenging and various obstacles as an astronaut, get ready to taste the heavy price of your mistakes, push your limits and reach the top!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><br>To Infinity is an experience where you witness the adventures of a schizophrenic astronaut. The astronaut takes a spaceship, escapes from Earth and starts looking for other planets where he can live. Meanwhile, he travels thousands of light years in space and witnesses the epic view of the universe.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TECHNOLOGY</h2><br>While making To Infinity, Unreal Engine 5.0, a new generation game engine, was used.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LANDSCAPES</h2><br>Since To Infinity is a game that aims for players to witness the epic view of the universe during the course, care has been taken to prepare the views as realistic as possible.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MECHANICS</h2><br>- Walk<br>- Running<br>- Jump<br>- Crouching<br>- Climbing<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GRAPHICS</h2><br>As TWISTED UNIVERSE, we attach great importance to graphics, so we used Unreal Engine 5, the last generation game engine, in To Infinity. We offer players a visual feast with much more realistic shadows and lighting.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PHYSICS</h2><br>To Infinity includes sections where you do physics-based parkour.",
    "about_the_game": "In To Infinity, a challenging parkour game, overcome challenging and various obstacles as an astronaut, get ready to taste the heavy price of your mistakes, push your limits and reach the top!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><br>To Infinity is an experience where you witness the adventures of a schizophrenic astronaut. The astronaut takes a spaceship, escapes from Earth and starts looking for other planets where he can live. Meanwhile, he travels thousands of light years in space and witnesses the epic view of the universe.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TECHNOLOGY</h2><br>While making To Infinity, Unreal Engine 5.0, a new generation game engine, was used.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LANDSCAPES</h2><br>Since To Infinity is a game that aims for players to witness the epic view of the universe during the course, care has been taken to prepare the views as realistic as possible.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MECHANICS</h2><br>- Walk<br>- Running<br>- Jump<br>- Crouching<br>- Climbing<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GRAPHICS</h2><br>As TWISTED UNIVERSE, we attach great importance to graphics, so we used Unreal Engine 5, the last generation game engine, in To Infinity. We offer players a visual feast with much more realistic shadows and lighting.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PHYSICS</h2><br>To Infinity includes sections where you do physics-based parkour.",
